WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
It's me, boss Feng Bei

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,120
Have stayed with you before

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,160
There should be points in the card now. It’s you.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:09,400
Why didn't you come out with the team today to ask for accommodation? No?

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,360
Did I come with my dad today or the same thing?

6
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,720
Let’s open an ordinary human room

7
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,040
My dad and I just need to be active

8
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,560
This is the room card for 204

9
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,320
From there, you can go upstairs. Dad, look.

10
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:21,040
This is the fairy spirit I told you along the way. Just swipe your card.

11
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,120
It will come out in a few seconds

12
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,280
A box of piping hot rice

13
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,880
God help my master, God help my master

14
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:29,560
There is such a magical thing in the ink room. I ordered two or three servings for my dad.

15
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,120
I need to eat enough today, hurry up

16
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:34,330
Dad, we don’t have enough points.

17
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:35,770
Do you still have a gold box in your hand?

18
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:37,730
Go ahead and rush a little harder

19
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:39,210
I can’t even figure out a meal.

20
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:41,370
Useless little boss who loses money

21
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,620
There's an automatic straightening machine over there, so go ahead and do it yourself.
